# WRS Portal Member Routing Addendum

**Status:** **PENDING SIGN-OFF** — mandatory companion to [WRS-001](./workspace-routing-standard.mdoc) §4 before Phase 3 cross-surface nav implementation (DL-41).

**Purpose:** Document every portal member route, future module routing, cross-surface transitions, and register-path families verified by the 2026-07-05 routing audit. **Does not replace WRS-001** — extends §4 where WRS lags repository truth.

**Source:** Blueprint v9 §48–53, DL-36..42, enterprise routing audit.

---

## 1. Relationship to WRS-001

| WRS-001 §4 today | This addendum |
| ---------------- | ------------- |
| Portal `/`, `/catalog/{id}/register`, `/me/registrations` | Adds `/me/profile`, `/me`, locale paths, BFF inventory, planned module paths |
| Cross-surface one-liner | Full transition matrix with GSH builders |
| No register-path families | Three families documented (DL-42) |
| No SEO boundary | Portal crawl policy (DL-39) |

**Merge timeline (DL-41):** Phase 3 (PS-4) blocked until this addendum is merged. WRS-001 §4 now links here as mandatory companion.

### Companion contracts in this addendum

| Topic | Section | Document |
| ----- | ------- | -------- |
| Builder Migration Contract | §7.1 | [builder-migration-contract.mdoc](../phase-19/member-portal-shell/builder-migration-contract.mdoc) |
| Module Registry + reserved ids | §3 | RFC §4.3.1 · DL-30 |
| Platform-owned Member Home | §3.1 | `/me/home` — id `home` |
| URL freeze | §8 | DL-03, DL-22 |
| Routing builder authority | §7 | [routing-builders-authority.mdoc](../phase-19/member-portal-shell/routing-builders-authority.mdoc) |
| guestCrossSurfaceNav | §4.2 | [guest-cross-surface-nav-schema.mdoc](../phase-19/member-portal-shell/guest-cross-surface-nav-schema.mdoc) |

