## 4. Marketing routes (cross-surface context)

### 4.1 Verified public catalog paths

| Path | Purpose | Notes |
| ---- | ------- | ----- |
| `/` | Club landing | |
| `/tours` | Public catalog list | WRS-PATH-01 |
| `/tours/{tourId}` | Tour detail + register CTA | CTA → portal register |
| `/en/*`, `/en/tours/*` | Locale-prefixed routes | `middleware.ts`, `resolveMarketingLocalePath` |

### 4.2 Platform-mother-only paths (DL-37)

These routes call `notFound()` on **club_apex** hosts unless platform-mother tenant:

| Path | File |
| ---- | ---- |
| `/about` | `apps/marketing/app/about/page.tsx` |
| `/contact` | `apps/marketing/app/contact/page.tsx` |
| `/pricing` | `apps/marketing/app/pricing/page.tsx` |

**Do not publish club stubs** for these three paths. Mother host still renders `MaintenancePage`. Club `notFound()` is presented by the **root** marketing 404 (`apps/marketing/app/not-found.tsx` + `catalog.pageNotFound`: «صفحه یافت نشد» / page does not exist / CTA `/`). That copy is **not** `catalog.notFound` («تور یافت نشد» / unpublished tour) — tour unpublished is owned by `apps/marketing/app/tours/[tourId]/not-found.tsx`. Document title segment is page-not-found; layout `title.template` yields `صفحه یافت نشد — {siteName}`.

**Audit finding:** `FULL_LANDING_NAV_LINKS` in `marketing-shell.tsx` L21–26 links `/about`, `/contact` on all club hosts → **404 on club tenants**. Target: `guestCrossSurfaceNav` manifest with `visibleWhen: platform_mother` (DL-05, DL-37). Phase 4 does **not** hide those nav links; it only fixes 404 presentation so a club guest who follows them does not see tour-unpublished copy.

### 4.3 Marketing SEO (verified — contrast with portal)

Marketing has `robots.ts`, `sitemap.ts`, pagination noindex. Portal has **no** `robots.ts` today (DL-39 gap).

---

## 5. Web (operator) routes affecting cross-surface flow

### 5.1 Verified paths

| Path | Surface intent | Behavior |
| ---- | -------------- | -------- |
| `/tours` | Operator tour list | **Not** public catalog (WRS-PATH-03) |
| `/tours/{id}/register` | Operator session registration | `apps/web/app/(app)/tours/[id]/register/page.tsx` — **distinct from public registration** |
| `/catalog/*` | Legacy shim | 308 → marketing `/tours` (when redirect enabled) |
| `/catalog/{tourId}/register` | Web egress shim | Redirect to portal register only |

### 5.2 `MARKETING_CATALOG_REDIRECT` (verified)

| Env | Behavior | Repo |
| --- | -------- | ---- |
| default / unset | Web `/catalog/*` → marketing | `apps/web/src/marketing/resolve-marketing-public-url.ts` |
| `MARKETING_CATALOG_REDIRECT=false` | Redirect disabled | Same file — test `WEB-MKT-06` |

### 5.3 Broken legacy alias (verified)

| Path | Status |
| ---- | ------ |
| `(app)/settings/tour-form-defaults` | Listed in operator route parity inventory; **no live page** — broken alias |

Documented for operator nav only — **not** a portal/member route. Fix is out of scope for member shell RFC unless operator settings work proceeds separately.

---

## 6. Register path families (DL-42)

Three families — **must never merge**:

| Family | Canonical path | App | Session | Purpose |
| ------ | -------------- | --- | ------- | ------- |
| **A — Public member registration** | `/catalog/{tourId}/register` | Portal | `atour_mb_session` (public-auth) | OTP + intake — **canonical** |
| **B — Web egress shim** | `/catalog/{tourId}/register` | Web (public) | Redirect only | Hands off to portal |
| **C — Operator registration** | `/tours/{tourId}/register` | Web (app) | `atour_op_session` | Operator workflow — not public |

Marketing CTA always targets **Family A** on portal host via `resolvePortalRegistrationUrl`.

---

## 7. Cross-surface routing matrix

All cross-host URLs **must** use Guest Surface Host (GSH) builders — WRS-URL-01 — except **web redirect shims** (Tier C) documented in [routing-builders-authority.mdoc](../phase-19/member-portal-shell/routing-builders-authority.mdoc).

**Builder Migration Contract:** [builder-migration-contract.mdoc](../phase-19/member-portal-shell/builder-migration-contract.mdoc) — governs `resolvePortalMemberModuleUrl` and deprecated `resolvePortalMemberAreaUrl`.

### 7.1 Marketing → Portal

| Transition | Builder | Authority | Migration |
| ---------- | ------- | --------- | --------- |
| Tour detail register CTA | `resolvePortalRegistrationUrl(host, tourId)` | GSH | Stable |
| Header/footer member area | `resolvePortalMemberModuleUrl(host, moduleId?)` | GSH | **Primary PS-3+** (sole builder since PS-7) |

**PCMS rule:** Marketing does **not** probe member session — static egress link only ([member-session-portal-authority.mdoc](./member-session-portal-authority.mdoc)).

### 7.2 Portal → Marketing

| Transition | Builder | Target |
| ---------- | ------- | ------ |
| Guest `/` (no session) | `resolveMarketingPublicBaseUrl(host)` | Marketing `/` |
| Register back / tour egress | `resolveMarketingTourDetailUrl(host, tourId)` | Marketing `/tours/{tourId}` |
| Logout → home | Client `router.push("/")` then marketing redirect | Marketing or portal `/` per smoke env |

### 7.3 Web → Portal

| Transition | Builder | Authority | Notes |
| ---------- | ------- | --------- | ----- |
| Public catalog register shim | `resolvePortalRegistrationRedirectUrl` | **apps/web** Tier C | Not GSH — redirect-only |

### 7.4 Web → Marketing

| Transition | Builder | Target |
| ---------- | ------- | ------ |
| `/catalog/*` redirect | `resolveMarketingToursUrl` / catalog redirect helper | Marketing `/tours` |
| Tour links (in-app) | Relative `/tours/{id}` on marketing host | Same host |

### 7.5 Registration success redirects (workspace plugins)

| Today (non-compliant) | Target |
| -------------------- | ------ |
| `<a href="/me/registrations">` in `denali-registration-flow.steps.tsx` L361 | Platform-injected GSH URL |
| Same in `urban-registration-flow.steps.tsx` L154 | Same |

Relative `/me/*` hrefs work only on portal host — fail if CTA renders cross-host (DL-38).

### 7.6 Registration redirect query params (planned)

| Param | Surface | Rule |
| ----- | ------- | ---- |
| `portalReturn` | Marketing register egress | Allowlist relative paths on marketing host only (DL-12) — **not implemented** |

---

## 8. URL freeze table (immutable)

Aligned with RFC §6 and Blueprint §48:

| URL | Surface | Notes |
| --- | ------- | ----- |
| `/tours`, `/tours/{id}` | Marketing | Public catalog |
| `/catalog/{tourId}/register` | Portal | Never under `/me/*` |
| `/me/registrations`, `/me/registrations/{id}` | Portal | Permanent alias for module `trips` |
| `/me/profile` | Portal | Profile module |
| `/` | Portal | Redirect hub — not bookmark target |
| `/me` | Portal | Redirect only (DL-40) |

**Breaking change rule:** Default member entry may change only if `/me/registrations` alias is retained.

---

## 9. Portal SEO & crawl boundary (DL-39) — planned

| Path class | Index policy | Repo today |
| ---------- | ------------ | ---------- |
| `/me/*` | noindex, nofollow | **Missing** |
| `/catalog/*/register` | noindex, nofollow | **Missing** |
| `/api/*` | Disallow crawlers | **Missing** |
| `/` | noindex (redirect hub) | **Missing** |

Deliverable: portal `robots.ts` and/or layout metadata — documentation only in this addendum.

